<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mot de passe oublié - Medina Group</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #1e88e5;
            --dark-color: #0d47a1;
            --light-color: #bbdefb;
            --danger-color: #e53935;
            --success-color: #43a047;
        }
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        
        body {
            background-color: #f0f2f5; /* A light background color similar to the image */
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        
        .forgot-password-container {
            background: #ffffff; /* White background for the dialog */
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 500px; /* Adjust max-width as needed to match the image */
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); /* Softer shadow */
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 30px; /* Reduced padding for a tighter look */
            text-align: center; /* Center content */
            position: relative; /* For the close button */
        }
        
        .close-button {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 15px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #aaa;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            line-height: 1; /* Ensure proper vertical alignment */
        }

        .close-button:hover {
            color: #666;
        }

        .logo-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        
        .logo {
            background-image: url('https://medinagroup.com.tn/lapaix/img/medina_logo.png');
            background-size: contain;
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            height: 70px; /* Slightly smaller logo */
            margin: 0 auto 10px; /* Center horizontally and add space below */
        }
        
        .title {
            font-size: 1.8rem; /* Slightly smaller title */
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--danger-color); /* Red color for "Mot de passe oublié?" */
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .message {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 30px; /* More space before contact info */
        }
        
        .contact-info {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin-bottom: 30px; /* Space before button */
            text-align: left; /* Align contact details left */
            display: inline-block; /* To center the block of contact info */
        }
        
        .contact-info li {
            display: flex; /* Use flexbox for icon and text alignment */
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 15px; /* Spacing between contact lines */
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #333;
        }
        
        .contact-info li:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        
        .contact-info .icon {
            margin-right: 15px; /* Space between icon and text */
            color: var(--primary-color); /* Icon color */
            font-size: 1.2rem; /* Icon size */
            width: 25px; /* Fixed width for icons to align text */
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* Basic Font Awesome-like icons (you'd use actual Font Awesome if available) */
        .icon-phone::before { content: "\260E"; } /* Unicode for phone */
        .icon-envelope::before { content: "\2709"; } /* Unicode for envelope */
        .icon-briefcase::before { content: "\1F4BC"; } /* Unicode for briefcase */
        .icon-globe::before { content: "\1F310"; } /* Unicode for globe with meridians */
        .icon-map-marker::before { content: "\1F4CD"; } /* Unicode for pushpin */
        
        .info-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-right: 5px;
        }

        .info-value {
            color: #555;
        }
        
        .understand-button {
            background-color: var(--danger-color); /* Red button as in the image */
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 40px; /* Wider button */
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        
        .understand-button:hover {
            background-color: #c62828; /* Darker red on hover */
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="forgot-password-container">
        <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="close-button">&times;</a> {# Link to close and go back to login #}

        <div class="logo-container">
            <div class="logo"></div>
        </div>

        <h1 class="title">Mot de passe oublié?</h1>

        <p class="message">
            Merci de contacter l'équipe informatique la paix
        </p>

        <ul class="contact-info">
            <li><span class="icon icon-phone"></span> <span class="info-label">Téléphone:</span> <span class="info-value">(+216) 72 240 211</span></li>
            <li><span class="icon icon-envelope"></span> <span class="info-label">Email:</span> <span class="info-value">informatique@medina.com.tn</span></li>
            <li><span class="icon icon-briefcase"></span> <span class="info-label">Poste:</span> <span class="info-value">508</span></li>
            <li><span class="icon icon-globe"></span> <span class="info-label">Site Web:</span> <span class="info-value"><a href="http://www.medina.com.tn" target="_blank" style="color: #555; text-decoration: none;">www.medina.com.tn</a></span></li>
            <li><span class="icon icon-map-marker"></span> <span class="info-label">Adresse:</span> <span class="info-value">Medina, Yasmine Hammamet Tunisie</span></li>
        </ul>

        <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="understand-button">COMPRIS</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>